DECLARE `o 32 r 2(2) kind of question` IS ONE OF
    `o 32 r 2(2)(a) a question arising in the administration of the estate of a deceased person or in the execution of a trust`
    `o 32 r 2(2)(b) a question as to the composition of a class of persons having a claim against the estate or a beneficial interest in the estate or in property subject to a trust`
    `o 32 r 2(2)(c) a question as to the rights or interests of a person claiming to be a creditor of the estate or to be entitled under a will or on the intestacy or to be beneficially entitled under a trust`
    `o 32 r 2(2) any other question`

