    `o 32 r 2(3)(b) an order requiring the payment into Court of money held by a person as personal representative`
    `o 32 r 2(3)(c) an order directing a person to do or abstain from doing a particular act as personal representative`
    `o 32 r 2(3)(d) an order approving any sale, purchase, compromise or other transaction by a person as personal representative`
    `o 32 r 2(3)(e) an order directing any act to be done in the administration of the estate or the execution of a trust which the Court could order if it were being administered or executed under the direction of the Court`
    `o 32 r 2(3) any other relief`

